MarketPrism (观澜)

This project derives from TradingAgents. The upstream research workflow and
retained source assets remain attributable to their original authors.
The original Apache License, Version 2.0 is retained in LICENSE.

MarketPrism modifications include Chinese A-share data integration,
Chinese desktop presentation, self-hosted authentication and data services,
server-side analysis, caching, and report management.

Internal identifiers inherited from the local AITrade adaptation are retained
for compatibility. The public-facing product name is MarketPrism.

Third-party dependencies remain subject to their respective licenses.
